00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,539
Together they make the whole base.

2
00:00:02,539 --> 00:00:06,276
So a equals b cos C plus c cos B.

3
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:11,536
Each side is the sum of the other two, each times the cosine of the angle next to it.

4
00:00:11,536 --> 00:00:17,109
If an angle is obtuse, its cosine is negative and the formula still holds.

